{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02975","headline":"与生公寻幽居处 · 张九龄","name":"与生公寻幽居处","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同方久厌俗，相与事遐讨。\n及此云山去，窅然岩径好。\n疑入武陵源，如逢汉阴老。\n清谐欣有得，幽闲歘盈抱。\n我本玉阶侍，偶访金仙道。\n兹焉求卜筑，所过皆神造。\n岁晚林始敷，日晏崖方杲。\n不种缘岭竹，岂植临潭草。\n即途可淹留，随日成黼藻。\n期爲静者说，曾是终焉保。\n今爲简书畏，秖令归思浩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}